Is it no longer possible to add notes to the sound card matrix?
I've tried a couple of times to add a note to the M-Audio Delta 1010
page. When I click on `Preview' it shows an error message saying
`Cannot submit without a note', despite the note being correctly
displayed. On clicking `Submit' an acknowledgement comes up but it
contains a PHP message about a fatal error in docs-add-notes-preview.php
line 386.
Judging from the date on the last note added by a user (2003) this has
been happening for a while.

John


